WEBVTT

01:06:57.371 --> 01:07:00.663
My last question today is about
ideas were spreading.

01:07:00.663 --> 01:07:04.454
If you could inject one idea into
the mind of everyone listening,

01:07:05.621 --> 01:07:07.538
what what would the idea be?

01:07:09.996 --> 01:07:11.454
We've touched on it a bunch,

01:07:11.454 --> 01:07:14.538
but the one idea would be the ajai
really is going to happen.

01:07:15.413 --> 01:07:17.121
You have to engage with it seriously,

01:07:17.579 --> 01:07:20.954
and you shouldn't just listen to this and
then brush aside and go about life

01:07:20.954 --> 01:07:24.371
as if it's not going to happen because
it is going to affect everything.

01:07:24.371 --> 01:07:27.788
And we will all we all, I think,
have an obligation,

01:07:28.038 --> 01:07:33.871
but also an opportunity to figure out what
not means and how we want the world